sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C1 as Booking request A
  participant C2 as Booking request B
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  C1->>DB: Begin; lock quota; select seat S for [2,5)
  C2->>DB: Begin; lock quota; select same candidate S
  Note over DB: Row lock / SKIP LOCKED serializes selection
  C1->>DB: Insert HELD allocation (run R, seat S, [2,5))
  C2->>DB: Insert competing overlapping allocation
  DB-->>C2: Exclusion constraint conflict; rollback all writes
  DB-->>C1: Commit hold + reservation + idempotency + outbox
  C2-->>C2: Bounded retry for another seat or typed conflict

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant X as Expiry worker
  participant B as Booking transaction
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  X->>DB: Select expired HELD rows FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
  B->>DB: Lock candidate allocation; recheck expires_at using DB time
  alt Expiry worker transitions first
    X->>DB: Mark hold/allocation EXPIRED; commit
    B->>DB: Re-select inventory; cannot reuse released seat without new lock
  else Booking safely confirms before expiry
    B->>DB: Transition HELD to CONFIRMED; commit
    X->>DB: Recheck state; skip confirmed allocation
  end
  Note over DB: Expired state is explicit; time is not used in partial index predicate
